Package: hexdig
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: binary signature scanner and extractor
 HexDig is a fast, extensible tool for scanning, inspecting, and
 extracting embedded data from binary files and firmware images.
 .
 It detects embedded file signatures, identifies compressed data,
 file systems and common firmware formats (UImage, SquashFS, CPIO,
 CRAMFS, ROMFS, UBI, FAT, MBR, ELF, PE, DTB, ZIP, 7Z, RAR, GZIP,
 BZIP2, XZ, LZMA and more), and can extract the discovered data
 either selectively or recursively in "matrioshka" mode.
